        "title": "Coding Is No Longer the Constraint: Scaling Developer Experience to Teams and Agents at Spotify",
        "link": "https://engineering.atspotify.com/2026/6/code-with-claude-coding-is-no-longer-the-constraint/",
        "source": "Spotify Engineering",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T22:18:41.143048+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T22:20:57.841449+00:00",
