        "link": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/the-us-offered-a-california-family-4-million-for-its-6300-acre-island-ranch-after-they-refused-the-government-seized-it-and-a-jury-awarded-them-12-7-million/articleshow/133406806.cms",
