        "title": "400 Cases Settled On First Day Of Supreme Court's 'Samadhan Samaroh' Mediation Scheme",
        "link": "https://www.livelaw.in/top-stories/400-cases-settled-on-first-day-of-supreme-courts-samadhan-samaroh-mediation-scheme-546910",
