        "title": "26/11 Mumbai Terror Attacks: Maharashtra Seeks Trial In Absentia Of 6 Pakistani Nationals Including Hafiz Saeed",
        "link": "https://www.livelaw.in/news-updates/2611-mumbai-terror-attacks-maharashtra-seeks-trial-in-absentia-of-6-pakistani-nationals-including-hafiz-saeed-546911",
