        "title": "Tupac Murder Trial Highlights a Persistent Diddy Conspiracy Theory",
        "link": "https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/general-news/tupac-murder-trial-duane-davis-diddy-conspiracy-theory-1236678743/",
