        "title": "Julie Klausner Calls Phone Comedy “Isolating” and “Reductive” at Live ‘It Happened in Hollywood’",
        "link": "https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/general-news/julie-klausner-it-happened-in-hollywood-difficult-people-1236678719/",
        "source": "The Hollywood Reporter",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T22:18:41.141748+00:00",
