    {
        "title": "AI didn't make me a worse coder. It made me a worse reviewer.",
        "link": "https://dev.to/dev_michael/ai-didnt-make-me-a-worse-coder-it-made-me-a-worse-reviewer-48d0",
        "source": "DEV Community",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
