        "title": "Amazon, Uber, DoorDash, and Walmart are taking the delivery wars to the skies",
        "link": "https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/amazon-uber-doordash-walmart-drone-delivery-wars/",
        "source": "Fortune | FORTUNE",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T22:18:41.140665+00:00",
