        "title": "Republicans say let them eat overpriced burgers, turning on Trump for ‘flooding the market with foreign beef’",
        "link": "https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/republicans-donald-trump-beef-import-announcement-consumers-expense/",
        "source": "Fortune | FORTUNE",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T22:18:41.140438+00:00",
