        "title": "Alex Jones no longer on-the-hook for $50 million owed to Sandy Hook families—but he still has $1.25 billion looming over his head",
        "link": "https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/alex-jones-50-million-sandy-hook-families-1-25-billion/",
        "source": "Fortune | FORTUNE",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T22:18:41.140434+00:00",
