        "title": "Iran modernizing defense industry in response to US-Israeli aggression: Defense Ministry",
        "link": "https://www.tehrantimes.com/news/529271/Iran-modernizing-defense-industry-in-response-to-US-Israeli-aggression",
        "source": "",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T21:38:57.180833+00:00",
