        "title": "California state Senator Aisha Wahab opposed by AIPAC wins California special election",
        "link": "https://www.tehrantimes.com/news/529277/California-state-Senator-Aisha-Wahab-opposed-by-AIPAC-wins-California",
        "source": "",
