        "full_content": "Best Google Pixel Watch 5 screen protectors\nA necessary add on for your Pixel Watch 5's own good.\nChoosing the best Google Pixel Watch 5 screen protectors isn't an easy job. It's easy enough to match your Pixel Watch 5 size variant to 41mm or 45mm screen protectors, but narrowing it down to one choice can be tough. There are so many decent options out there, after all. This is exactly why I have rounded up the best picks in terms of quality, price, performance, and durability, and gathered them here in one place. Enjoy your shopping, and don't forget to grab a sweet Pixel Watch 5 band or two afterward.\nHave your pick of the best Pixel Watch 5 screen protectors\nWhy you can trust Android Central\nBest overall\nThe ZAGG Ultra Eco Smart Watch Screen Protector for the Pixel Watch 5 is a plant-based, self-healing, scratch-proof protector with a lifetime replacement warranty. Choose the 41mm or 45mm option based on the size of your Pixel Watch 5.\nBest oleophobic (45mm)\nThe EGV 6 Pack Google Pixel Watch 5 45mm Screen Protector TPU Film consists of six malleable TPU films designed to fit the 45mm Pixel Watch 5 perfectly. It is scratch resistant, can self-repair, and has a water and dust-repellent oleophobic coating.\nBest oleophobic (41mm)\nThe EGV 6 Pack Google Pixel Watch 5 41mm Screen Protector TPU Film is designed for all 41mm Google Pixel Watches, including the first iteration. This 41mm six-pack of oleophobic films can be shared by multiple Pixel Watch owners across generations.\nBest installation kit\nThe Ringke Dual Easy lineup of screen protectors spans across many devices, smartphones and wearables alike. The Google Pixel Watch 5 variant comes with two of the Korean brand's self-repairing EPU films and a very handy installation frame.\nBest U.S.-made (45mm)\nArmorSuit's MilitaryShield HD Clear TPU films are all made in the U.S.A, so if you're looking to support local products, this is an excellent pick. This is the 45mm Google Pixel Watch 5 variant, with six pieces of self-healing, scratch-proof protectors included.\nBest U.S.-made (41mm)\nDon't worry if you chose the 41mm size option of the Google Pixel Watch 5, because the American-made ArmorSuit MilitaryShield HD Clear TPU Film 6 Pack is also available in the smaller size.\nPick the right set of Pixel Watch 5 screen protectors\nThe best overall Google Pixel Watch 5 screen protector is the plant-based creation from ZAGG. The ZAGG Ultra Eco Smart Watch Screen Protector for the Google Pixel Watch 5 might be a bit pricey at $24.99, but it comes with a no-questions-asked lifetime replacement warranty. This will basically pay for itself over the years! Plus, you get a very high quality edge-to-edge impact and scratch-proof screen guard with ZAGG's own Self-Healing Nano-Memory Technology. You get an installation tray and cleaning kit in the box as well.\nBargain hunters will find that virtually every other pick that I have listed here is very affordable. If you want to split the difference between a budget buy and a branded pick, Ringke has a great two-pack for below $20. This includes two high-grade EPU films with self-repairing properties and an installation and alignment tool that simplifies the installation process.\nFor bottom-of-the-barrel deals, both EGV and AmorSuit have $10 kits with six units of TPU screen protectors for the Pixel Watch 5, available in both 41mm and 45mm variants. You can't go wrong with either, as both are very well-reputed names in the biz.\nGet the latest news from Android Central, your trusted companion in the world of Android\nNamerah enjoys geeking out over accessories, gadgets, and all sorts of smart tech. She spends her time guzzling coffee, writing, casual gaming, and cuddling with her furry best friends. Find her on Twitter @NamerahS.",
