        "title": "Mint Mobile will basically give you a FREE year of wireless when you buy the Google Pixel 11 — here's how it works",
        "link": "https://www.androidcentral.com/phones/google-pixel/mint-mobile-will-basically-give-you-a-free-year-of-wireless-when-you-buy-the-google-pixel-11-heres-how-it-works",
