        "full_content": "Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra price drop alert! Get flagship device with a discount of over Rs 30000 on Amazon\nSamsung Galaxy S25 Ultra gets a major price cut on Amazon.\nBuyers can save more through bank and exchange offers.\nThe flagship offers powerful performance, premium design and advanced cameras.\nIf you’ve been eyeing to grab a flagship device, then the last-generation flagship device, the Samsung Galaxy S25, is currently selling with a heavy discount on Amazon. Aside from the flat price reduction, the consumers can also club in bank and card offers to further reduce the net effective price of the smartphone. The handset comes packed with the Snapdragon 8 Elite chipset and offers up to 12GB of RAM and 1TB of internal storage. Not only that, but at the rear end you also get a quad-camera setup to ensure that you can capture all the important moments in the highest quality. However, one thing to keep in mind is that it’s a limited-time offer and may end soon. Here is a clear breakdown of how the Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra deal works on Amazon.\nSamsung Galaxy S25 Ultra Amazon deal\nThe Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra debuted in the Indian market with a price tag of Rs 129,999, but Amazon has currently listed it for just Rs 94,999, which is a flat discount of Rs 35,000. Consumers using the Amazon ICICI Bank credit card to make the purchase can save an extra 5 per cent if they are prime members. However, the non-prime members can also get a decent 3 per cent extra discount.\nFor the users who don’t want to pay the whole price upfront, the e-commerce brand is also offering no-cost EMI starting at just Rs 3,340 per month. You can also check out the exchange programme on Amazon if you’re upgrading. Depending on the brand model and working condition of your old model, you can get an exchange bonus of up to Rs 33,500. Do note that these offers are available for a limited period and may change depending on stock availability.\nSamsung Galaxy S25 Ultra: Is