        "title": "How soon will the drought be over?",
        "link": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c0kmlrkypjpo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
        "source": "BBC News",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T21:38:57.179414+00:00",
