        "title": "PySkyWiFi: completely free, unbelievably stupid wi-fi on long-haul flights",
        "link": "https://robertheaton.com/pyskywifi/",
        "source": "Robert Heaton | Blog",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T21:38:57.179135+00:00",
