        "title": "Greg Abbott Grasps At Anything to Stir Up Anti-Islam Panic for His Reelection",
        "link": "https://talkingpointsmemo.com/where-things-stand/greg-abbott-grasps-at-anything-to-stir-up-anti-islam-panic-for-his-reelection",
