        "title": "Trump Administration to Support ‘Independent Journalism’ in Europe With Anti-Immigrant Focus",
        "link": "https://talkingpointsmemo.com/news/trump-administration-to-support-independent-journalism-in-europe-with-anti-immigrant-focus",
