        "title": "Airports Authority refutes claim NMIA runway extension project causing seawater ingress in Port Royal",
        "link": "https://www.jamaicaobserver.com/2026/08/21/airports-authority-refutes-claim-nmia-runway-extension-project-causing-seawater-ingress-port-royal/",
