ted APTEL to remit the matter back for reconsideration, which was refused on Aug 19.\nMERC said, “APTELheld that the Commission’s request for reconsideration of the matter was intriguing and insinuated that the same was an attempt to aid MSEDC in forum shopping.”Maharashtra CM Devendra Fadnavis cited several examples of arbitrary adverse treatment of public utilities by APTEL and requested PM to order an examination of the tribunal’s functioning to ensure that justice is delivered and interests of govt companies are protected.",
