ia and northern Iraq. Trump said he remained optimistic about reaching an agreement but warned military action would resume if diplomacy failed.\nOil prices fell sharply after the bombing campaign was suspended, while Washington and Tehran continue to dispute the terms of a June framework agreement governing navigation through the Strait of Hormuz and future negotiations.\nkA.ABD",
