        "title": "7 hour sit-in by Rahul, Congress brass, pellet victim force Delhi Police to file FIR",
        "link": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/politics-and-nation/7-hour-sit-in-by-rahul-congress-brass-pellet-victim-force-delhi-police-to-file-fir/articleshow/133411336.cms",
