    {
        "title": "Maharashtra: Finance portfolio snub, internal rift test NCP’s unity",
        "link": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/politics-and-nation/maharashtra-finance-portfolio-snub-internal-rift-test-ncps-unity/articleshow/133412175.cms",
