        "title": "Rush Hour: Rahul Gandhi’s sit-in for pellet-injured youth, CJP team attacked at Jaipur school & more",
        "link": "https://scroll.in/latest/1095180/rush-hour-rahul-gandhis-sit-in-for-pellet-injured-youth-cjp-team-attacked-at-jaipur-school-more?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=public",
