        "title": "\"Today you are students; tomorrow you will be scientists, artists, leaders\": UP CM calls for deeper India-Japan youth ties",
        "link": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/today-you-are-students-tomorrow-you-will-be-scientists-artists-leaders-up-cm-calls-for-deeper-india-japan-youth-ties/articleshow/133409089.cms",
        "source": "India News | Latest India News Today & Real-time News from India, India Breaking News",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-21T21:05:23.144606+00:00",
