        "title": "Kishtwar girl dies after ‘forced abortion’ bid, teacher held",
        "link": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/kishtwar-girl-dies-after-forced-abortion-bid-teacher-held/articleshow/133412649.cms",
