        "title": "NIA court denies bail to woman facing trial in Pulwama terror attack case, asks jail authorities to provide medical care",
        "link": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nia-court-denies-bail-to-woman-facing-trial-in-pulwama-terror-attack-case-asks-jail-authorities-to-provide-medical-care/articleshow/133412722.cms",
