        "title": "Sir Vivian Richards Visits Bedford School, Inspiring Students and Strengthening Sporting and Community Ties",
        "link": "https://antigua-barbuda.com/sir-vivian-richards-visits-bedford-school-inspiring-students-and-strengthening-sporting-and-community-ties/",
