        "title": "Apple vs OpenAI: Legal battle escalates as iPhone maker rejects dismissal plea",
        "link": "https://www.businesstoday.in/technology/news/story/apple-vs-openai-legal-battle-escalates-as-iphone-maker-rejects-dismissal-plea-550601-2026-08-21?utm_source=rssfeed",
