        "title": "Will Tukaram Mundhe enter politics? Here's what the Maharashtra FDA commissioner said",
        "link": "https://www.businesstoday.in/india/story/will-tukaram-mundhe-enter-politics-heres-what-the-maharashtra-fda-commissioner-said-550579-2026-08-21?utm_source=rssfeed",
