        "title": "PSA: In the latest GTA 6 leak's aftermath, it's not a good idea to download files with names like totallylegitgta6leakedbuild.exe",
        "link": "https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/psa-in-the-latest-gta-6-leaks-aftermath-its-not-a-good-idea-to-download-files-with-names-like-totallylegitgta6leakedbuildexe",
