        "title": "SimCity SNES Soundtrack Makes A Surprise Return In This Week's Nintendo Music Update",
        "link": "https://www.nintendolife.com/news/2026/08/simcity-snes-soundtrack-makes-a-surprise-return-in-this-weeks-nintendo-music-update",
