        "title": "Take-Two's legal action to find GTA 6 leaker begins, as it subpoenas Microsoft and Discord for any data \"sufficient to identify the users person\"",
        "link": "https://www.eurogamer.net/take-two-legal-action-gta-6-leeks-cyberleek",
        "source": "Eurogamer.net Latest Articles Feed",
