ch does not offer a free trial. Disney+ offers several subscription bundles depending on your viewing habits, including options with Disney, Pixar, Marvel, Star Wars and Nat Geo, plus Hulu Originals and FX.\nMore on each TV streaming option below.\nDirecTV\nSince Hulu is included in any of DirecTV’s Signature packages (Entertainment, Choice, Ultimate or Premier), new subscribers can watch the full first season of The Girls with the service’s five-day free trial.\nLearn more about each DirecTV plan option, including how to build your own channel lineup (starting at just $20.99 per month), at directv.com.\nHulu/Disney+\nThe Hulu/Disney+ bundle plans start at $11.99 per month, with regular monthly or six-month price options available.\nPlans can include Disney, Pixar, Marvel, Star Wars and Nat Geo through Disney+, plus Hulu Originals and FX. Higher-priced options add HBO Max or ESPN’s networks and services, with premium plans offering features such as ad-free movies and series as well as downloads.\nWhere to Watch The Kardashians Online\nWatch Khloé Kardashian and the rest of her family in The Kardashians on Hulu/Disney+.",
