        "title": "Michelle Pfeiffer Reveals Career Plans After Saying She “Never” Wanted to “Star in Another Movie”",
        "link": "https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/michelle-pfeiffer-reveals-career-plans-never-star-in-movie-1236678525/",
        "source": "The Hollywood Reporter",
