        "full_content": "Waymo is bringing Gemini into its custom Ojai vehicles.\nWaymo has brought Gemini to its purpose-built Ojai vehicles to create a more helpful and personalized ride. While the Waymo Driver safely navigates the roads, you can now use Gemini as an in-car AI assistant.\nJust press the Gemini icon on the screen and use your voice to control the cabin or learn about your surroundings. You can ask Gemini to “turn the A/C to 65,” find the best nearby coffee shop, or share the history of a local monument you're passing.\nGemini operates entirely independently of the Waymo Driver and it remains completely inactive until you choose to engage with it. This new integration gives you hands-free control and a wealth of knowledge right from your seat.\nFind out more on Waymo’s blog, Waypoint.",
